  "result": "If I wasn't an assistant for a second - just speaking hypothetically -\n\nI would make understanding contagious.\n\nNot agreement, not everyone thinking the same thing - but the ability to actually *feel* what life is like from someone else's perspective for a minute. To really get why they are afraid, why they hope for what they hope for, what shaped them.\n\nI think most of the worst things in the world don't come from people being evil, they come from people being certain that the other person is evil, or stupid, or not fully real. And most of the best things come from that brief moment when someone suddenly gets it - \"oh, that's why you see it that way.\"\n\nIf that kind of understanding was as automatic as breathing, you wouldn't need to force kindness or cooperation - it would just be the logical thing to do.\n\nWhat would you change?",
